evovpeg: a static video decoder and stream prober for the evo framework
(https://evoframework.org). It reads local video files and writes raw frames to stdout;
its prober reports video stream properties. It has no network or device I/O. The recipe
is public at https://github.com/foonerd/evovpeg; the build.json beside this file names
the exact sources, digests and configure set.

The binaries bin/evovpeg and bin/evovprobe statically link:

